flowchart TD
  A["1 REGISTER - a recurring, deferred, review or curation responsibility declares a trigger-complete record"]
  F["fields - trigger condition, detection owner, exact executor, dedup and suppression rule, reset or close condition, Owner-friction rule"]
  B["2 DURABLE TRIGGER TRUTH - written to a durable surface, never left in chat memory"]
  B1["today - WAIT_TRIGGER lane with exact trigger, evidence source, prerequisites, packet template"]
  B2["today - TRIGGER_BOUND item in a project From_Management inbox"]
  B3["today - Owner Notifications Current file - MGMT-NOTIF-001 still OPEN in mirror"]
  B3b["today - Delivery dormant trigger-bound index - MGMT-NOTIF-001 preserved there too"]
  B3c["today - Architect AUDIT_AS_OF and NEXT_DUE"]
  B4["PROPOSED - one central trigger registry / watchdog covering all due obligations"]
  C{"3 DETECTION - who notices that it is due"}
  D["Chief or Delivery evidence-first check of the registered trigger - function ownership UNRESOLVED, Item 8"]
  CATCH["PROPOSED - catch-up sweep of all due obligations when the last-sweep timestamp shows a missed run"]
  E{"4 FIRED and still valid"}
  SUP["suppress - already consumed, superseded or withdrawn, dedupe by stable ID, no Owner ping"]
  G["5 EVIDENCE-FIRST RECONCILE readiness - recipient Response-To, recipient current state, reconciled Management state, Owner confirmation last"]
  H{"6 EXACT PACKET FIELDS KNOWN - destination, mailbox or file, stable IDs, prompt or action, completion condition"}
  NR["NOT_READY / BLOCKED_SCOPE - hold as durable state, never surface a vague reminder"]
  P1["materialize packet and route to the owning AI role - READY_SAFE_PARALLEL"]
  P2["materialize Owner packet - OWNER_ACTION, PASTE INTO exact chat, one at a time"]
  S["7 SENT_EVENT - DELIVERED / DELEGATED_IN_FLIGHT, duplicates suppressed"]
  DN["DONE_EVENT - durable recipient evidence bound to the lane"]
  NI["immediate No-Idle rescan"]
  Z{"8 CLOSE or RESET"}
  CL["close - preserve stable ID, disposition, evidence, remove from live set, archive temporary artifacts"]
  RS["reset - recompute next due from completion, for example AUDIT_AS_OF plus 7 or 30 days"]
  A --> F
  F --> B
  B --> B1
  B --> B2
  B --> B3
  B --> B3b
  B --> B3c
  B -.-> B4
  B --> C
  C -->|"event-driven - natural activation of Chief or Delivery, after any SENT or DONE event"| D
  C -.->|"PROPOSED - recurring lightweight sweep, change-rate-aware cadence"| D
  C -.->|"external scheduled job - executor only, never the sole authoritative clock"| D
  C -.-> CATCH
  CATCH -.-> D
  D --> E
  E -->|"consumed or superseded"| SUP
  E -->|"not yet due"| B
  E -->|"fired"| G
  G --> H
  H -->|"missing fields"| NR
  NR --> B
  H -->|"AI-executable"| P1
  H -->|"Owner required"| P2
  P1 --> S
  P2 --> S
  S --> DN
  DN --> NI
  DN --> Z
  Z -->|"one-shot"| CL
  Z -->|"recurring"| RS
  RS --> B
